OL,4,CCanadian astronaut welcomes baby girl  
OL,5,Cfrom space station                     
OL,6,GA Canadian astronaut aboard the        
OL,7,GInternational Space Station is         
OL,8,Gcelebrating the birth of his third     
OL,9,Gchild from hundreds of miles above     
OL,10,GEarth.                                 
OL,12,FJoshua Kutryk and his wife, Heather    
OL,13,FKutryk, welcomed their daughter as the 
OL,14,Fastronaut takes part in a six-month    
OL,15,Fspace mission that began in October,   
OL,16,Fthe Canadian Space Agency announced on 
OL,17,FTuesday.                               
